<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <section
    id="introduction"
    class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] pb-16 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr] lg:gap-16"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="mb-5 font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">A note from my desk</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl font-medium leading-[0.95] text-[#30231a] sm:text-7xl">
        I design software and guide the work from idea to release.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#4f4034]">
        I am a senior full-stack software engineer with more than a decade of experience across
        backend, frontend, data, infrastructure, and system design. I now use coding agents to
        produce the implementation. I decide what needs to be built, guide the technical work,
        review the result, solve problems, test the system, and decide when it is ready.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#4f4034]">
        I bring the experience of more than 80 CRM, SaaS, and e-commerce projects to that work.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#5d412d]">
        <a
          id="email-andrei"
          href="mailto:mail@scripness.com"
          class="border-b border-[#8d6b50] pb-1 hover:text-[#2d1e14]"
        >
          Write to me
        </a>
        <a
          id="resume-link"
          href="/assets/andrei-scripcaru-technical.pdf"
          class="border-b border-[#8d6b50] pb-1 hover:text-[#2d1e14]"
        >
          Read my résumé
        </a>
        <a href="tel:+37378181261" class="border-b border-[#8d6b50] pb-1 hover:text-[#2d1e14]">
          +373-78-181-261
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside id="background" class="mt-12 border-l-2 border-[#9b7659] pl-6 lg:mt-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Background</h2>
      <dl class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-sm leading-6">
        <div>
          <dt class="font-semibold text-[#765d46]">Experience</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-[#4f4034]">
            More than a decade building full-stack products
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-semibold text-[#765d46]">What I know</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-[#4f4034]">
            Backend, frontend, data, infrastructure, and operations
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-semibold text-[#765d46]">How I build now</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-[#4f4034]">
            Coding agents produce the implementation; I guide and check the work
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-semibold text-[#765d46]">Location</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-[#4f4034]">Moldova</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">Some of my work</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Projects</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-[#6b594a]">
        The résumé holds the full chronology. These notes give a little more context.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-2 md:grid-cols-2">
      <details id="project-cryptoli" class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Cryptoli</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:hidden">read note +</span>
            <span class="hidden text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:inline">close −</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-[#6b594a]">
            Latest project · Cryptocurrency review and community platform
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          I applied my full-stack experience across its website, backend, admin tools, community
          features, moderation, search, notifications, analytics, and real-time features. It also
          gave me practical experience using coding agents from planning and system design through
          review, testing, and running the product.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm italic leading-6 text-[#765d46]">
          TypeScript · NestJS · Next.js/React · PostgreSQL · Redis · Playwright
        </p>
      </details>

      <details id="project-financialdocs" class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">FinancialDocs</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:hidden">read note +</span>
            <span class="hidden text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:inline">close −</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-[#6b594a]">
            Full-Stack Engineer · Contract · Remote · May 2025–Jan 2026
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          Maintained three paystub platforms serving hundreds of users while evolving a shared
          codebase of 2,000+ service classes. Architected legaldocs.com with a 14-collection CMS
          model, document generation, dual payments, and webhook-driven CDN caching.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details id="project-nixap" class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">NIXAP</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:hidden">read note +</span>
            <span class="hidden text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:inline">close −</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-[#6b594a]">
            Full-Stack Engineer · Contract · Hybrid · Apr 2024–Apr 2025
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          Built client applications and internal tools, including a multi-tenant VoIP system
          integrating PBX/SIP protocols with a desktop application for call management.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details id="project-dispatch42" class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Dispatch42</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:hidden">read note +</span>
            <span class="hidden text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:inline">close −</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-[#6b594a]">
            Full-Stack Developer · Full-Time · In-Office · Nov 2022–Aug 2023
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          Architected a real-time logistics CRM with a microservices backend and mobile app,
          plus serverless notifications and proprietary hardware data feeds.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details id="project-travod" class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Travod</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:hidden">read note +</span>
            <span class="hidden text-sm text-[#765d46] group-open:inline">close −</span>
          </span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-[#6b594a]">
            Full-Stack Developer · Full-Time · In-Office · Apr 2019–Oct 2020
          </span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          Developed Traduno, an in-house translation services CRM, and led a GraphQL API layer
          over its existing Ruby backend.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 border-l-2 border-[#9b7659] pl-6 md:grid-cols-[0.6fr_1.4fr]">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Earlier work</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#6b594a]">
          A compact chronology from the full résumé.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="columns-1 gap-10 text-sm leading-7 text-[#4f4034] sm:columns-2">
        <p><strong>Rio</strong> — live-streaming backend and frontend.</p>
        <p><strong>Crawless</strong> — browser automation IDE backend and CRM.</p>
        <p><strong>Deditech Com</strong> — B2B CRM and home rental platform.</p>
        <p><strong>eToro</strong> — backend API for a recruitment application.</p>
        <p><strong>MKM</strong> — UK e-commerce with CRM and payment APIs.</p>
        <p><strong>GoodLeap</strong> — solar-financing microservices and workflows.</p>
        <p><strong>RentInsider</strong> — Romanian and European rental platform.</p>
        <p><strong>Virail</strong> — high-traffic travel search features.</p>
        <p><strong>Deutsche Fintech Solutions</strong> — financial micro-frontends.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Independent Freelancing</strong>
          — 80+ CRM, SaaS, and e-commerce projects from 2011 to 2019.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="technical-profile" class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">
          The tools and experience behind my work
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Technical Profile</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          Technologies I have used across more than a decade and 80+ projects. This experience
          helps me design systems, guide agents, review their work, find problems, and test the
          result. TypeScript and PHP are where I have the longest history.
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-7 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Programming</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            TypeScript, JavaScript, PHP, Ruby, Python, Kotlin, Go, C#, Elixir, Delphi
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Frontend</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            React/Next.js, Vue/Nuxt, Svelte, Electron, Flutter, Tailwind
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Backend</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            Node.js, NestJS, Bun, Deno, Laravel, Symfony, Phalcon, Rails, Django, Flask, Express, AdonisJS
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Data & interfaces</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, DynamoDB, Elasticsearch, Redis, REST, GraphQL, tRPC, OpenAPI
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Infrastructure</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            AWS, GCP, Azure, Docker, Fly.io, Vercel, Caddy, PM2, GitHub Actions
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Testing</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            Jest, Cypress, Playwright, RSpec, Pest, Cucumber; unit, integration, smoke, and end-to-end checks
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-[#9b7659] pt-3 sm:col-span-2">
          <dt class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-[#30231a]">Practices</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#5d4b3d]">
            Microservices, DDD, clear specifications, coding agents, code review, automated tests, browser testing, releases
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-i-work" class="border-b border-[#b9a58e] py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">Building software with coding agents</p>
      <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">How I work</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[#4f4034]">
        Coding agents produce the implementation. I still own the engineering work: understanding
        the problem, making technical decisions, reviewing what was built, testing it, and deciding
        when it is ready.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="mt-10 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-9 md:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">1.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Understand the problem</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I make sure the goal, expected behavior, limits, and signs of success are clear before work begins.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">2.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Plan the system</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I decide how the parts should fit together, including data, APIs, operations, risks, and existing behavior.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">3.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">
            Guide the agents
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I give agents clear direction and check the complete result. When something is wrong,
            I find the cause and make sure it is fixed properly.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] gap-4">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl italic text-[#9b7659]">4.</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Review and test</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I review the work and test the important behavior in code and in the browser. I decide when the result is ready to release.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="ask-me-about" class="py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg italic text-[#765d46]">Good conversation starters</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-5xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">Ask me about</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
          The experience behind the résumé and how I build software today.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t-2 border-[#8d6b50]">
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            Working across many stacks
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            TypeScript and PHP are where I have the deepest history. I have also worked with JavaScript, Ruby, Python, Kotlin, Go, C#, Elixir, and Delphi. This helps me guide work across a full system and understand where problems come from.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            80+ projects as a freelancer
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            From 2011 to 2019, I delivered 80+ projects across CRM, SaaS, and e-commerce, handling client requirements, architecture, implementation, and ongoing maintenance across web, desktop, and mobile stacks.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            Legacy codebases
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            At FinancialDocs, I maintained three paystub platforms while building a new legal document platform, evolving a shared codebase of 2,000+ service classes without breaking production across three interconnected products.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border-b border-[#cfbeaa] py-5">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#30231a] [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
            Building with coding agents
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-[#4f4034]">
            I use agents to produce the implementation while I guide the work. I review and test
            what they build, solve the difficult problems, and remain responsible for the result.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="contact" class="mt-20 border-y-2 border-[#8d6b50] py-10 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl italic text-[#765d46]">
        If this way of working fits what you need,
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-medium text-[#30231a]">
        come and tell me about the problem.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#5d412d]">
        <a href="mailto:mail@scripness.com" class="border-b border-[#8d6b50] pb-1">
          mail@scripness.com
        </a>
        <a href="/assets/andrei-scripcaru-technical.pdf" class="border-b border-[#8d6b50] pb-1">
          Résumé (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layouts.app>
